ation).\"\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/e2e2/run.log:1:INFO:patch:HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES='2,3' is not a logical index set of ROCR_VISIBLE_DEVICES='0,1' (HSA renumbers the visible agents); re-pinning to '0,1' so the benchmark child actually sees the selected GPU(s).\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/e2e2/run.log:2:INFO:patch:benchmark child PATH does not provide 'vllm'; prepending the Magpie-hosting environment bin '/opt/envs/vllm/bin' so the framework CLI and the python3 that imports it resolve inside the InferenceX script.\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/e2e/run.log:1:INFO:patch:HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES='2,3' is not a logical index set of ROCR_VISIBLE_DEVICES='0,1' (HSA renumbers the visible agents); re-pinning to '0,1' so the benchmark child actually sees the selected GPU(s).\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/e2e/run.log:2:INFO:patch:benchmark child PATH does not provide 'vllm'; prepending the Magpie-hosting environment bin '/opt/envs/vllm/bin' so the framework CLI and the python3 that imports it resolve inside the InferenceX script.\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/wt/Magpie/modes/benchmark/benchmarker.py:64:def align_rocm_visible_devices(env: Dict[str, str]) -> Dict[str, str]:\n/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76/runs/specialist/d00cdedfc173451eaf5b312d08e00da9/scratch/wt/Magpie/modes/benchmark/benchmarker.py:117:            \"(HSA renumbers the visible agents); re-pinning to %r so the \"\n/home/qi